y  entire career  uh to be incredibly well compensated and  so um  but i i just it's never been something  that i've been jealous of other guys  or you know felt like other guys weren't  deserving of it i'm for everybody  uh you know making what they can make  and getting what they can get and  you know because to be honest with you  for as long as i've played you see  people who get injured at different  times our game is so  uh one play at a time that you know i'm  all four people getting what they can  get when they can get it  what was your reaction when brady signed  with the buccaneers  i was like come on man  uh no i mean i kind of  my gut was kind of telling me you know  this this could be a potential landing  spot for them  uh having played against them last year  knowing how good their defense was the  weapons that they have on offense i  thought you know this could this could  be a potential landing spot for him when  he announced he wasn't going back to new  england so  i wasn't all together too surprised  because i thought it would be a good fit  have you ever had a conversation with  him about that super bowl  uh no just he sent some text messages  after that game  and uh you know i i'm not sure i'm  i'm i'm not sure i'm still in a good  enough place to have a a  a reasonable conversation with him about  i'm not sure i'll ever be there but but  if you played golf with him  would you bring it up or would you wait  for him to bring it up  uh i i think you got to rip the band-aid  i'm at a voice in my life  uh where i found in these kind of things  i think you just gotta get it out there  and throw it out there and so yeah i  think if i were you know  having a beer with him or or playing  golf or something like that i think it'd  be like man so  why'd you have to do that why'd you have  to go there  because you know that he loves to talk  trash but i don't there's certain things  that you  are those off limits he's always  to be honest with you you know in the  passing  you know the times i've seen him in  passing or the conversations that i've  had with him he's always been super  respectful  okay uh and you know so  i don't think he needs to talk any trash  there's nothing that really needs to be  said uh what are you doing with gatorade  well i'm happy yeah to be able to uh  promote eric gilbert uh who i got to  spend time with in december and  announced when he was the uh national  football player of the year but  uh they're announcing he's the 2020 male  athlete of the year at the high school  level so  uh just you know congratulating him i've  come full circle in this spot saw him as  the football player last year  excited to see what he does at lsu and  excited for him because it's  you know it's an incredibly prestigious  award the most prestigious in high  school  uh sports because it takes into account  not only what you did on the field but  also  you know who you are as a person and  what you did into the classroom so you  know huge congratulations to him  if it wasn't boston college where were  you going  i was kind of between a couple different  places iowa purdue  and some of those schools in the big ten  but uh  boston college was was always kind of  the spot i wanted to play for whatever  reason my uncle played there i grew up  one of the you know one of the few  boston college fans there are  you know i grew up a bc fan and i've  always wanted to go there  uh just for the record you're not going  to opt out this season you are going to  play for the falcons  i'm going to play i'm already in the  building uh and all checked in and all  that stuff i guess  guys have until the third and you know i  respect that decision for for people to  make it but  uh you know i feel comfortable you know  with with playing this year  great to visit with you again good luck  uh in that division  you don't have too many uh thank god the  panthers are there  they're not very good but the saints and  buccaneers  they're going to test you a little bit  there man yeah you never know  you never know how it's going to go but  uh it's going to be a tough one this  year for sure we've got to work it out  first  thank you thank you matt great to talk  to you be safe  that's matt ryan falcons quarterback
 

